div.p:
I am more than happy to here record the fact that all apprehensions as to the
                    effect of the presence of so large a military force in Texas proved groundless;
                    no disturbances occurred; the conduct of the troops was exemplary, and the
                    public reception and treatment of them was all that could have, been desired,
                    and this notwithstanding the presence of a large number of Mexican refugees in
                    the border territory.
